    "result_text": "The build is green \u2014 `BUILD SUCCESS`, `Tests run: 1, Failures: 0, Errors: 0`. The audit log confirms the new format working end-to-end: `memberId=NSW2716E6609E1` (region `NSW` + FY `27` + HASH8 `16E6609E` + Luhn CHK `1`).\n\n## Summary\n\nI unified `customerCode` and `membershipNumber` into a single `memberId` formatted `<REGION><FY><HASH8><CHK>`, and removed the standalone `checkDigit`.\n\n**Identity computation** \u2014 `AssignCustomerCode` \u2192 renamed to `AssignMemberId` (`rest/function/owner/`):\n- Builds `region + FY + hash8`, where `region` = `OwnerLocality.of(city, postcode)`, `FY` = `FiscalYear.twoDigit(registrationDate)`, and `hash8` = the same first-8-upper-hex SHA-256 over `normalizedTelephone + lastName` used before.\n- Appends a single Luhn check digit (`CHK`) computed over the digits of `<REGION><FY><HASH8>`.\n- Collision handling now de-duplicates the whole `memberId` (append `-<n>`).\n\n**Model** (`Owner.java`) \u2014 renamed the persisted field/column `customerCode`/`customer_code` \u2192 `memberId`/`member_id`, and removed the derived `getCheckDigit()` transient (its Luhn digit is now the `CHK` segment).\n\n**Consumers now reference `memberId`:**\n- `OwnerLocality.forOwner` \u2014 derives the region from the leading letters of `memberId` (before the numeric FY segment), so the owner segment follows.\n- `AuditOwnerCreated` \u2014 audit line now logs `memberId` (dropped the separate `membershipNumber`).\n- `OwnerCreatedEvent` \u2014 record field + JSON key are now `memberId`.\n- `OwnerMapper` \u2014 removed the `membershipNumber` expression mapping; `memberId` maps by name.\n- `FiscalYear` \u2014 javadoc updated.\n\n**Contract & schema:**\n- `openapi.yml` \u2014 replaced `customerCode` with `memberId`, removed `membershipNumber` and `checkDigit` (regenerates `OwnerDto`).\n- DB schemas (hsqldb/h2/mysql/postgres) \u2014 `customer_code VARCHAR(20)` \u2192 `member_id VARCHAR(30)`.\n- Updated the `owners.POST.yml` pipeline to reference `AssignMemberId`.\n\nThe acceptance test `coreReturnsUnifiedMemberId` (which asserts the `NSW` prefix, the embedded HASH8, and the absence of the old fields) passes.",
